item.description:
2025 Year-End Summary: Noise Reduction, Refactoring, and Long-termism After Christmas comes New Year&rsquo;s Day. I just tried to organize my thoughts verbally, but was interrupted halfway by the cat. After feeding it, I continued writing.
Standing at the tail end of 2025, looking back at this year, if last year was about &ldquo;searching,&rdquo; then this year was about &ldquo;confirming.&rdquo;
1. Work and Open Source: Embracing AI&rsquo;s Duet This year&rsquo;s technical review can be summarized as: Working in a new environment, patching up in open source, and fully embracing AI.
